   "title": "说明 · 夜市百相簿（闻灯 · 先脸后身 v19）",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "角色：闻灯 · 24 岁男性 · 半妖借形人 / 旧市夜巡所临时书记\n底模：leosamsHelloworldXL_helloworldXL70（SDXL）  |  896×1152  |  Clip Skip 1（CLIPSetLastLayer = -1）\n采样：dpmpp_2m + karras，第一段 30 步 CFG 10 denoise 1.0 → ESRGAN 放大 → 第二段 20 步 CFG 10 denoise 0.25\nseed 固定 20260916（两个 KSampler 都是 fixed，别开随机）\n\n【★ 出图流程铁律——先脸后身】\n  ① 先只出「脸部正面」，确认这个人没问题；\n  ② 再用同一组角色 token + 同一 seed 出「左侧脸 / 右侧脸」；\n  ③ 脸全部确认后，才出全身图。\n  理由：v18 就是因为脸和身用了两套描述词，出成\"脸是成年男、身是少年\"的两个人。\n  角色 token 块（脸/身必须逐字复用）：\n      1boy, solo, 24 year old east asian man, masculine face, strong jaw, messy wavy black hair\n\n【当前阶段：脸部正面】A段=节点2，B段=节点3，负向=节点5+18+19（三段合并）\n  换视角只改 A 段最前面的取景词：front view, looking at viewer / side profile view, facing left / facing right\n\n【下一步：全身图】脸部确认后再切，A段换成：\n  full body shot, head to toe, front view, standing straight, arms down at sides, hands visible, 1boy, solo, 24 year old east asian man, masculine face, strong jaw, messy wavy black hair, small mole at outer eye corner, faded blue shirt, dark worn trench coat, open coat, pure white background\n  B段换成：\n  1boy, wavy tousled hair, tired eyes, thick eyebrows, stubble, weathered skin, detailed skin texture, skin pores, film grain, worn wrinkled clothes, dark trousers, old worn shoes, arms down at sides, hands visible, pure white background, even lighting, sharp focus, photorealistic\n  负向第三段（节点19）换成 N3_FULL：\n  hands in pockets, hands behind back, hands hidden, holding object, prop, contrapposto, wide stance, legs apart, pockets, extra fingers, bad hands, watermark, text, blurry, lowres, busy background, grey background, dark background, gradient background, vignette, shadow, airbrushed, over-smoothed\n\n【锚点（不可改，详见 comfyUImd/.workbuddy/memory/角色视觉锚点-锁定.md）】\n  黑发微卷 / 眼尾一颗小痣 / 洗得发白的蓝色旧衬衫 / 深色旧风衣 / 旧鞋 / 眼带睡眠不足\n  禁止：现代警察制服、古装侠客、偶像妆、夸张肌肉、少年化脸孔\n  道具（账簿、朱砂粉盒）不进角色设定图，之后单独生成\n\n【纯白背景】提示词只能给到浅灰，最终靠脚本后处理：\n  _scripts/post_whitebg.py <图片路径> --t 12\n"
   ],
